# Ticket volume

data tickets = month,Tickets; Jan,15210; Feb,14380; Mar,16950; Apr,17210; May,16480; Jun,21740; Jul,23960; Aug,20110; Sep,18420

chart line tickets x=month y=Tickets title="Tickets per month, January to September"

# Tickets by category

data cats = category,September tickets; Refunds,5130; Booking changes,4470; Baggage,3260; Loyalty points,2410; App login,1840; Other,1310

chart hbar cats unit=tickets labels title="September tickets by category"

# CSAT by channel

table = Channel,Tickets,Median first response (h),CSAT; Chat,8920,0.3,4.5; Email,6140,6.8,3.9; Phone callback,2210,1.1,4.4; Social,1150,3.2,4.0

# Notes

- The June and July spike came from the summer schedule changes.
- The new refund self-service form launched on 2026-08-12.
- Email response times remain the weakest point.

!! Refunds are still the largest category despite the new form.
